                  },
                  "text": "<strong>4</strong> &nbsp; We built the AI sentiment index to measure how the industry is changing, how we feel about it, and what it means for the future of design. Researcher Shane Johnston breaks down <strong><u>how AI helped make sense of a huge amount of data.</u></strong>",
